# UI Design

## Visual language

- Elevated **surface cards** with theme shadow tokens — **no `borderWidth: 1` on cards**
- Generous spacing from theme tokens (e.g. `spacing.md` for card padding)
- Radius from tokens (`sm` / `md` / `lg`)
- Full dark/light parity via shared theme package

## Primitives

Prefer a small shared UI kit (e.g. `SurfaceCard`, list rows, icon badges, filter chips) over one-off styled views. Document the kit in `docs/architecture/` when it exists.

## Theme helpers

- Tint icon wells with alpha helpers from the theme package
- Apply card shadows via theme helpers, not ad-hoc multi-layer shadows

## Anti-patterns

```tsx
// BAD — hard-coded color
<View style={{ backgroundColor: '#1a1a1a' }} />

// BAD — bordered card
<View style={{ borderWidth: 1, borderColor: theme.colors.border, borderRadius: 12 }} />

// GOOD — token-based surface primitive
<SurfaceCard>...</SurfaceCard>
```

## Borders allowed on

- Text inputs, outline buttons, hairline dividers only

## Icons

Lucide-first — see `150-images-and-icons.mdc`.
